{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>9to5Mac 由 MacPaw 旗下嘅 CleanMyMac 贊助。隨住 macOS 27 Golden Gate 推出，用 CleanMyMac 先騰出空間、優化系統，等你部新 Mac 第一日就發揮十足效能。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 係 macOS 26 Tahoe 嘅重大升級，唔單止係設計決策更加聰明。亦同 iOS 27 for iPhone 一樣，Mac 加入咗 Liquid Glass 外觀滑桿，可以大幅改變成個系統嘅視覺風格。</p>\n<h2>滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 由 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用嘅設計語言。最初 Liquid Glass 只有單一外觀，Apple 之後加入咗設定選項，等 Liquid Glass 可以冇咁透明。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 Golden Gate 開始，Liquid Glass 唔再局限於兩種風格。Apple 改為加入外觀滑桿，可以將 Liquid Glass 調得比以前更通透，亦可以調成更具實感但仍然現代嘅霧面外觀。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 預設為中等設定，系統亦會喺首次設定時邀請你調整滑桿。之後亦可以喺「系統設定 &gt; 外觀」度再調校。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿會即時預覽每個設定嘅效果。三格刻度分別代表最透明、中等同最霧面，但你亦可以喺刻度之間自由調整任何位置。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock</h2>\n<p>Dock 係跟住 Liquid Glass 滑桿設定而改變外觀嘅最明顯元件。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>佢可以由清晰顯示你嘅桌面背景圖片，到變成更具實感同輪廓分明嘅材質。</p>\n<p>以下係近睇效果：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>Widgets</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面 Widget 可以係全彩色、暗色，或者自動切換。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變暗色 Widget 嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcasts</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcasts 等擁有系統「播放中」 bar 嘅應用程式，會因應 Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅位置而有截然不同嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>以 Podcasts 嘅「播放中」 bar 為例：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而 Music 嘅「播放中」 bar 就係：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>更多</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦會套用喺側邊欄、工具列同工具列按鈕，改變「相片」、Safari 同其他有視窗邊框嘅應用程式外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate Liquid Glass 滑桿有一個特點，就係單一滑桿控制成個系統嘅 Liquid Glass 外觀。即係話 Dock、Widget 同視窗邊框都會用同一種風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊種？更透明、更霧面，定係中間？我自己就覺得霧面選項喺我部 Mac 上面睇落又靚又成熟。不過玩下更透明嘅效果其實都幾有趣，好高興 macOS 27 Golden Gate 畀大家自決嘅選擇。</p>\n<p>喺留言分享你嘅睇法啦！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T21:39:16.451595+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1194,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}